# Access Control Testing

Evaluate authorization and visibility rules.

## For Each Feature

Identify:

- Who can view
- Who can edit
- Who can approve
- Who can finalize

## Required Tests

Authorized Access

- User can perform allowed actions

Unauthorized Access

- User cannot perform restricted actions

Visibility

- User sees only permitted data

Navigation

- Direct URL access restrictions

Session Scenarios

- Session expiration
- Permission changes
- Role switching

## High Risk Focus

- Compensation visibility
- Salary edits
- Approval actions
- Administrative functions

## Output

Generate:

- Authorization matrix
- Positive tests
- Negative tests
- Security risks